      "Extremely Simple",
      "",
      "One day, the teacher said during class, “We have an exam tomorrow!”",
      "",
      "The students asked, “Will the exam be difficult?”",
      "",
      "The teacher said, “Extremely simple!”",
      "",
      "The students thought: If it’s “extremely simple”, then it’s “very simple”!",
      "",
      "Everyone was very happy!",
      "",
      "The next day, after the exam everyone thought that the test was very difficult, and not simple.",
      "They asked the teacher, “Teacher, didn’t you say that it was ’extremely simple’? Why did we think it was so difficult?”",
      "",
      "The teacher said, “That’s right! What I said was: of the exam questions, ..",
      ".. ’10 points’ are very simple and ‘90 points’ are very difficult.”"
